"kind":"announcement","title":"Tom the Postgirl releases on October 29! 🎀","summary":"Hello everyone,Tom is finally ready to deliver her packages across town and uncover all sorts of nasty secrets. We are thrilled to announce that Tom the Postgirl will officially release on Steam and Nintendo Switch on October 29!Try the game before October 29Can't wait to start snooping around and spy on your neighbors? We have a demo available on Steam to get a little taste of Tom the Postgirl before the big adventure starts. Until then... you better lock your doors 👁️","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T08:06:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067943275","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2257440-1845383656380401","game_id":"steam-2257440","kind":"announcement","title":"New trailer, showcases, and Steam Next Fest! 📦","summary":"Hello everyone, We have some very exciting news to share with you today. Things are getting busy for Tom the Postgirl, and we have a lot of cool events coming up this October… alongside lots of private lives to spy on.Check out our new trailer We just released a brand-new \"Coming Soon\" video! You can watch it on YouTube or on our Steam page right now to get a fresh look at the village, the weird locals, and Tom doing what she does best: delivering mail and nosing into things that are (technicall","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-01T08:56:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656380401","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2257440-1841579228675088","game_id":"steam-2257440","kind":"announcement","title":"Our new Tom the Postgirl demo is OUT NOW! ✉️","summary":"Dear town folks, Something strange is happening in the village… Tom has been busy delivering packages, knocking on doors, peeking through windows, and generally minding everyone’s business. And now, you can join her!Your new favourite (questionable) hobby The village may look charming, but don’t let the cute flowers and cosy houses fool you. Everyone has something to hide, and Tom is more than happy to learn more about the inhabitants and their nasty secrets. With this updated demo, you’ll get a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-24T10:03:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228675088","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2257440-1830797770236534","game_id":"steam-2257440","kind":"announcement","title":"Tom the Postgirl news: Publisher and Games Made In France","summary":"Dear towns folks, We noticed that you haven’t had news from Tom in a while, but we assure you, she has not abandoned her job as a postgirl! On our side, we have pretty existing news: First, ARTE France officially becomes the publisher of Tom the postgirl! Also, to our French speaking folks, Tom the postgirl will showcase an exclusive demo during the Games Made In France online event!You’ll get to learn more about the development, gameplay and Tom’s story. Don’t miss it, on April 26th, 2026, at 8","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-24T15:32:41Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770236534","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2257440-1795283637812236","game_id":"steam-2257440","kind":"announcement","title":"SUGOI!!","summary":"From the terrific creators of the awesome TGAGWCAGA (The Game Awards for Games Who Can't Afford the Game Awards), here comes the SUGOI showcase, and here we are!!! 🎉 If it wasn't in your vocabulary so far, \"SUGOI\" comes from Japanese and means amazing, wonderful, great, fantastic. Now that you know that, you can only imagine how cool the selection is! 🔥 You will have from March 27 to April 3 to take a look at the line up of more than 30 incredible games the SUGOI team picked out 👀 Additionally, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-03-27T08:06:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1795283637812236","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2257440-6146943657174064246","game_id":"steam-2257440","kind":"announcement","title":"Tom the postgirl: Watch the devs play!","summary":"Event Information We're part of the AdventureX Sales Event from Nov. 4 - Nov. 11. We'll run multiple events and announce them here. Apologies if you see several announcements. About Tom the Postgirl This spooky adventure follows the mischevious Tom on her deliveries which surprisingly always go wrong. No wonder, she is a real stalker and peeks inside whenever she gets the occasion to. Go along with her and see what the locals may have to hide.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-11-05T14:54:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6146943657174064246","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2257440-6146943657174064201","game_id":"steam-2257440","kind":"announcement","title":"Tom the postgirl: FAQ on the balcony with the devs","summary":"Event Information We're part of the AdventureX Sales Event from Nov. 4 - Nov. 11. We'll run multiple events and announce them here. Apologies if you see several announcements. About Tom the Postgirl This spooky adventure follows the mischevious Tom on her deliveries which surprisingly always go wrong. No wonder, she is a real stalker and peeks inside whenever she gets the occasion to. Go along with her and see what the locals may have to hide.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-11-05T14:50:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6146943657174064201","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2257440-5742731639325905078","game_id":"steam-2257440","kind":"announcement","title":"Day of the devs X Tom the postgirl","summary":"Dear all, We are excited to announce that we'll be part of the Day of the Devs Summer Game Fest Edition's showcase, highlighting upcoming indie games! ✨ The initial broadcast takes place LIVE on YouTube Theater🎥 ⏱️Friday, June 7, directly following SGF Live, around 4am PT So don't miss out on the presentation of their crazy line-up! For the occasion, we'll put our demo back online and leave it for the duration of the Summer Game Fest. (and probably some more time after that 😇) See you soooon 👀","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-05-29T09:47:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5742731639325905078","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2257440-5766372999959527958","game_id":"steam-2257440","kind":"announcement","title":"FAQ on the balcony","summary":"With the temperatures rising, we decided to take the stream on the balcony in order to go through some questions. We hope you enjoy this little sunbath while we feed you with some crispy fun facts!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-05-06T22:02:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5766372999959527958","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2257440-5766372999959526840","game_id":"steam-2257440","kind":"announcement","title":"Fun facts with the devs, watch us play!","summary":"As part of our participation in the LudoNarraCon, we sit down together to play through our demo which is available online for the very first time! While playing, we will share fun facts about in-game elements as well as exchange about our experience developing it. This is our very first time recording ourselves in a stream setting, so please bear with us as we try to figure it out :$ See you at the stream!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-05-06T22:02:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5766372999959526840","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2257440-5759616966661860352","game_id":"steam-2257440","kind":"announcement","title":"Tom the postgirl is part of LudoNarraCon 2024!","summary":"Short but exciting news, we're part of this year's Official Selection of the LudoNarraCon's narrative games festival, kicking off on May 9! For the occasion, we have a couple things brewing. 1. A demo will be released shortly so all of you can finally get a feel of stalking. The final game is still very much a Work in Progress, but we are happy to give you access to this first edition! 2. Two livestreams will be happening, one commented play-through as well as a chill FAQ session. Keep an eye ou","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-04-24T19:26:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5759616966661860352","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","conte